OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump arrives in Ireland
OL,4,Afor two-day visit as major security
OL,5,Aoperation in place
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,8,Fin Dublin for the start of his two-day
OL,9,Fvisit to the Republic of Ireland -
OL,10,Fwatch live above
OL,12,FTrump is greeted with a guard of honour
OL,13,Ffrom the Irish military as he meets
OL,14,FIrish President Catherine Connolly at
OL,15,Fher official residence in Phoenix Park
OL,17,FHe will later hold a meeting with
OL,18,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,19,FMicheal Martin
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
