OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump arrives in Ireland
OL,4,Afor two-day visit as major security
OL,5,Aoperation in place
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump will then travel to his golf
OL,8,Fresort in Doonbeg, County Clare, where
OL,9,Fthe Irish Open golf tournament is being
OL,10,Fheld
OL,12,FIrish authorities have been planning
OL,13,Ffor Trump's visit for months in what
OL,14,Fwill be one of the biggest security
OL,15,Foperations in the history of the state
OL,17,FProtests against the president's visit
OL,18,Fare expected to be held in Dublin and
OL,19,FDoonbeg
